This repository contains both **Hardware designs** (KiCad schematics, PCB layouts, Gerber/BOM manufacturing files) and **Documentation**, as well as **Software/Firmware source and binary code** (RP2040 C/PIO firmware and 8-bit 6502/Z80/6809 diagnostic ROMs).

This project is released under a **Dual-Licensing Model**:
1. **Free for Personal, Hobbyist, Educational, and Research Use** (under the non-commercial terms specified below).
2. **Commercial License Required for Any For-Profit Activity**: Any commercial manufacturing, distribution, or sale (of assembled boards, DIY kits, bare PCBs beyond cost-recovery, or devices pre-flashed with this project's firmware/ROMs) on marketplaces (e.g., eBay, Tindie, AliExpress, Amazon, Etsy), online/physical stores, or retro-computing expos **is strictly prohibited without prior written authorization and a commercial license agreement from the Author**.

